{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_50191","headline":"咏青（伯二五六七） · 孟浩然","name":"咏青（伯二五六七）","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"雾辟天光远，春回日道临。\n草浓河畔色，槐结路旁阴。\n欲映君王史，先标胄子襟；经明如何（可）[一]拾，自有致云心。\n（《国秀集》卷下、《全唐诗》卷二○三皆收此诗爲校书郎荆冬倩之作，作孟诗恐误。\n）（[一]依刘校。\n）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"孟浩然","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_50191.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_50191","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}